  rate_notes:
    - "Damage rates are theoretical maxima: every shell or torpedo fired at its reload hits for its full damage. Not applied: fires, flooding, citadel and overpenetration multipliers, armor, dispersion, shell flight time, turret traverse and ammo switching. Guns: damage_per_minute = barrels x damage x 60 / reload. Torpedoes: damage_per_minute = torpedoes_per_minute x damage. damage_per_second = damage_per_minute / 60. broadside and bow_on count only the barrels that bear at the bearing inside that arc where the most damage bears, as ship_firing_arcs reports; broadside is 30-150 or 210-330 off the bow, bow_on 331-29. An ammo with modules is carried only with those modules; its base uses them."
    - "Main battery in Burst Fire: each turret fires shots salvos interval apart, then reloads for reload. damage_per_minute averages one burst and that reload: barrels x damage x shots x 60 / ((shots - 1) x interval + reload). during_burst is the rate while a burst fires: barrels x damage x 60 / interval."
changes:
  - stat: Main Battery Reload Time
    from: 5.5 s
    to: 40.0 s
  - stat: Minimum Shell Type Switching Time
    from: 5.5 s
    to: 40.0 s
  - stat: Main battery damage per minute (HE)
    from: 366545 hp/min
    to: 140651 hp/min
  - stat: Main battery damage per minute (AP)
    from: 654545 hp/min
    to: 251163 hp/min
